      "type": "Text",
      "props": {
        "text": "Every link, badge, deploy button, Docker reference, and CI guard in the codebase rewritten from aaronjmars/MiroShark and MiroShark/MiroShark to aeonfun/MiroShark. The repo is now fully canonical under the aeonfun org."
      }
